					"text": {
						"type": "text",
						"value": "SLICE TO SHAPE\n\nThe Slice to Shape node converts the incoming slices to shapes. This means that you can use shape operations like Union, Subtract and Edge on them before you convert them to textures.\n\nIn this example we use Slice to Shape to create an outline of the slices using the Edge node."
					}
